{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56354","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 慎独二章（一章十句，一章八句）（慎独，闭邪存其诚也。） 二 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 慎独二章（一章十句，一章八句）（慎独，闭邪存其诚也。） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲舒格言，许绪深旨。\n灵怀发中，神资素履。\n吻契洵猷，践扬前轨。\n蔼蔼令名，烂光青史。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}